{"id":"5f4292020626280b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-global-choice-function.md","title":"ZFC Global Choice Function","display":"df-zfc-global-choice-function — ZFC Global Choice Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-global-choice-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-global-choice-function"],"display":"df-zfc-global-choice-function — ZFC Global Choice Function","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-global-choice-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-global-choice-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-global-choice-function — ZFC Global Choice Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (class relation in conservative class notation; its restriction to any set is a choice relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"332bc4fce3564b85\" href=\"?note=332bc4fce3564b85\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md\">../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ClassRel}\">\\(\\mathsf{ClassRel}\\)</span> (metasort of class-relation parameters in the conservative class-notation schema)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S:\\mathsf{ClassRel}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S:\\mathsf{ClassRel}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}global\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S(F) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists!y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land y\\in x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\to x\\neq\\varnothing\\land y\\in x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}global\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S(F) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists!y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land y\\in x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\to x\\neq\\varnothing\\land y\\in x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a proper-class parameter, not a set in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; the display is a conservative class-notation schema over ZFC.</li>\n<li>Existence of such an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is the additional global-choice principle and is not asserted by this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"332bc4fce3564b85","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F$ (class relation in conservative class notation; its restriction to any set is a choice relation, see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ClassRel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S:\\mathsf{ClassRel}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}global\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{GlobalChoiceFunction}_S(F) \\leftrightarrow \\forall x\\;\\bigl(x\\neq\\varnothing\\to\\exists!y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land y\\in x)\\bigr)\\land\\forall x,y\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in F\\to x\\neq\\varnothing\\land y\\in x)","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1291,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-global-choice-function.md|58-df-zfc-global-choice-function]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","332bc4fce3564b85"]}